@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M02 — PDF settings without implicit link changes
actor Owner as U
participant "Tailored resume" as R
participant "PDF availability" as D
participant "Rendition context" as A
U -> R : Open PDF settings for intended resume
R -> R : Check current owner-control authority
alt Denied
 R --> U : Denied; no settings disclosure/change
else Authorized
 R -> D : Read current mode / language choices
 D -> A : Read actual eligible artifact availability
 A --> D : Available / missing / processing / failed
 D --> U : Current settings and availability
 U -> D : Save selected mode and language choices
 D -> D : Validate authority and requested configuration
 alt Confirmed save
  D --> U : Effective saved configuration
 else Invalid, failed or unconfirmed save
  D --> U : Actual unapplied/failed result
 end
end
note over R,D
Saving settings does not disable or re-enable a sharing link.
Mode selection does not create a missing artifact.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
